    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23347" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δᾱλός</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαίω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fire-brand,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				15.421
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.488
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				471
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				472
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				608
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				344a26
			</span></i>; <i>beacon-light,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				9.675
			</span></i>; of the thunderbolt, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				13.320
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tim.</u>
				2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a kind of
				<i>meteor,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				341b28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>burnt-out torch</i>: metaph. of an old man, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				12.41
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>). (Contr. fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δᾰϝελός,</span> cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαβελός.</span>)</div>
